   <description>
      <short>
         <en>More Security plugin adds an extra layer of security to GLPI by blocking login attempts and password resets.</en>
      </short>
      <long>
         <en>More Security improves the native login behavior of GLPI by protecting both login attempts and password reset requests. It makes it harder for attackers to impersonate users by enabling organization whitelists, limiting failed login attempts, and providing a dedicated security dashboard. This product includes DB-IP Lite data created by DB-IP (https://db-ip.com/), available under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)</en>
      </long>
   </description>
